@page "/quotations"

<PageTitle>Quotations — Trishul</PageTitle>

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4">
    <div>
        <h1 class="h3 mb-1 fw-bold">Quotations</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Create, manage, and convert business price estimates into invoices.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="trishul-card">
    <div class="trishul-card-body text-center py-5">
        <div class="empty-state-icon text-primary bg-primary bg-opacity-10 mb-3" style="width: 4rem; height: 4rem; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto;">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
                <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
                <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
                <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Quotations Module Planned for Future Sprint</h3>
        <p class="text-muted mx-auto mb-4" style="max-width: 500px;">
            In accordance with <strong>Sprint 1</strong> boundaries, quotations are intentionally deferred while the UI layout and Customer Management foundation are verified.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-3 justify-content-center text-start mx-auto mb-4" style="max-width: 600px;">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded border">
                    <div class="fw-semibold text-dark mb-1">📋 Upcoming Features</div>
                    <ul class="text-muted small mb-0 ps-3">
                        <li>Quotation drafting & numbering</li>
                        <li>Multi-item line item pricing</li>
                        <li>GST / Tax calculation</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded border">
                    <div class="fw-semibold text-dark mb-1">⚡ Next Steps</div>
                    <ul class="text-muted small mb-0 ps-3">
                        <li>Customer dropdown binding</li>
                        <li>1-Click conversion to Invoice</li>
                        <li>PDF generation & download</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="customers" class="btn btn-primary">
            Explore Customers Screen
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
